  "solution": {
    "text": "Potential difference across the central limb = 16 V = Potential difference across <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#937;</mtext></math> = Potential difference across the left limb.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mo>current through</mo> <mo>16</mo> <mtext>&#937;</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>A</mo> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mo>current through the left limb</mo> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mo>A</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>R</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>&#964;</mi><mtext>c</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>ohms</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>F</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>40</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>&#956;</mtext><mtext>s</mtext></math>",
